# Every content and schema change needs a human owner's approval.
#
# This is the enforcement point for the clean-room policy: agents open content
# pull requests, mechanical CI verifies the citations, and a human owner is the
# last gate before anything publishes. See CONTENT-POLICY.md.

/content/                @mashkovd
/content/schemas/        @mashkovd

# Policy documents. Changing these changes the rules the project operates under,
# so they get the same gate as content itself.
/CONTENT-POLICY.md       @mashkovd
/SOURCES.md              @mashkovd
/LEGAL.md                @mashkovd
/PRIVACY.md              @mashkovd

# CI and deployment wiring — the evidence gate lives here, so a change to it is
# a change to the gate.
/.github/workflows/      @mashkovd
